        "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Discord &amp; Check our Roadmap!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/f06a81fda0ea30f20fa01825e8278518.avif?t=1784282568\" width=800 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/234c19f57a961b91f0d93d81c6a87459.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1560 height=1113 /></span></p></p><br><h1>1.0 Version vs. Demo</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/0914e25077d7c82ba20fc753b0aaee3c.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1560 height=1113 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Our Official <strong>Discord</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(You can access Discord link from the panel on the right.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/9cd90ef45bc52840f1b1ca7de026bea8.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=647 height=145 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/9cd90ef45bc52840f1b1ca7de026bea8.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1784282568\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras_big/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1784282568 width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dusty corner of memory, the toy room stirs once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken forgotten childhood toys and fuse them within the small table to craft your own kaboom legion — from ground collisions to aerial strikes and magical blasts. Through each tabletop battle, fragments of your long-lost childhood return…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/a653b63d714b86955e7dee9864fe0e53.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/a653b63d714b86955e7dee9864fe0e53.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >            </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/ab089feb23e65783cd22fd7da4aeeeee.avif?t=1784282568\" width=800 height=151 /></span>Arrange, Combine, and Evolve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of toy arrangement on your tabletop! Every toy slot is a strategic decision. Plan your layout, combine rare units, and arrange them wisely to unlock your build’s full potential!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/0cd5c17d1d9144065316e884b3b64a8a.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1038 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/0cd5c17d1d9144065316e884b3b64a8a.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own tactical system from over 400 strategic toys!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ summons to clash in tabletop battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ traps and class abilities to outsmart your opponents and shift momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >250+ magic items and weapons to power up your strategy and unleash devastating combos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/7673602b1e8ba7e8d4f95a0d04e740f9.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1038 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/7673602b1e8ba7e8d4f95a0d04e740f9.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/6e20767586a723ddd9db20c28e3b95fe.avif?t=1784282568\" width=800 height=151 /></span>Collisions &amp; Knockback</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon toys into head-to-head battles where it’s not just about stats—brave charges and knockback strikes can send enemies flying, turning the tide in unpredictable ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/46c587976bc0ceb868280986daf56704.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1038 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/46c587976bc0ceb868280986daf56704.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set Traps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set traps across the table to break enemy momentum and open up opportunities to strike back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/17395743d0ca2baf2f73de9b107b418a.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1038 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/17395743d0ca2baf2f73de9b107b418a.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/27dda68a2e9077b32cda1e362120cfee.avif?t=1784282568\" width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in asynchronous PvP where your legion clashes with global builds in tactical showdowns. Analyze, adapt, and optimize your strategy in mirror matches and rise through the ranks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Toy Captain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero brings a unique toy arsenal and exclusive class abilities.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doll Chef: A kitchen defense expert who controls space and fortifies positions, perfect for defensive-minded players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Hamster: Commander of Hamster Legion that leads a swarm of tiny units to overwhelm enemies with relentless numbers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puppet Musician: A rhythm master who speeds up allies and disrupts foes, setting the tempo of every battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naughty Andy: Summoner of nightmares — ghosts, skeletons, reapers, and dark curses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frost Hunter: Rule the frozen land, command wild beasts, and unleash the power of water magic!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/1e63d83ac7ce2509e89327d1cd31dc84.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1038 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/1e63d83ac7ce2509e89327d1cd31dc84.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/1e63d83ac7ce2509e89327d1cd31dc84.mp4?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn Your Friends into Toys</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your Steam friends into fully armed &quot;Game Buddy&quot;, customize them with all kinds of weapons and attributes, then rally them into your toy army to charge into battle for friendship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/94db0d27bbaadb2b4039fd821e3fd86f.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/94db0d27bbaadb2b4039fd821e3fd86f.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/23d4e0504e4ee58cbba2996543e9fd46.avif?t=1784282568\" width=800 height=151 /></span>Unveil Toy Memories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock achievements, hero skins, and the toys’ hidden memories through a pop-up storybook. Within its dusty pages, the long-lost tales of Fred and his childhood friends quietly come back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/71aa0f8faa68e007cfa7f83d91d7f5d8.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1038 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/71aa0f8faa68e007cfa7f83d91d7f5d8.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1784282568\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras_big/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1784282568 width=800 height=91 /></span></p>",
